        <mxCell id="c65" value="&lt;i&gt;Model view lists each table&#x27;s columns in alphabetical order and draws the relationship between the tables; the mock draws each line to the related columns so that they can be read. Power BI&#x27;s 1 and * replace the crow&#x27;s feet of Chapter 3.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="334" width="860" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
